      "message": "```\ndiff --git a/zephyr/program/fpmcu/testcase.yaml b/zephyr/program/fpmcu/testcase.yaml\nindex 0bf6671fc5..baa1d7b3ae 100644\n--- a/zephyr/program/fpmcu/testcase.yaml\n+++ b/zephyr/program/fpmcu/testcase.yaml\n@@ -199,6 +199,8 @@ tests:\n   sha256_unrolled:\n     extra_configs:\n     - CONFIG_HW_TEST_SHA256_UNROLLED\u003dy\n+    - CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_SHA256_SW\u003dy\n+    - CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_SHA256_UNROLLED\u003dy\n     extra_conf_files:\n     - prj_hw_tests.conf\n   static_if:\n```\nThe output logs are: https://paste.googleplex.com/4753034425008128\n\nThese are the same errors observed before the configs were disabled and enabled only for bloonchipper as in https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/6794064",
